    "n": "Hivemill v0.2.0 is a pre-release: a redesigned web UI, a faster pull request loop and a much harder worker sandbox, on top of the v0.1.0 chain of Claude Code agents. Most new automation is opt-in and off by default.\n- **Opt-in worker sandbox.** Namespace allow-list view, worker-only login, masked `/run` and detection of sandbox escapes. Per-role GitHub token files are supported; scoping those tokens is part of your own setup, see [SECURITY.md](https://github.com/volekerb/hivemill/blob/main/SECURITY.md) and "
